  "slug": "chinese-cabbage-and-carrot-salad-with-cashew-and-ginger-dres",
  "title": "Chinese cabbage and carrot salad with cashew and ginger dressing",
  "blurb": "Crisp ribbons of Chinese cabbage and carrot tossed with toasted cashews and a zingy ginger and lemon dressing.",
  "steps": [
    "Toast the cashew nuts in a dry frying pan over medium heat for 3 to 4 minutes until golden, then roughly chop them.",
    "Finely slice the Chinese cabbage and peel the carrots into ribbons with a vegetable peeler.",
    "Peel and finely chop the shallot and ginger, then place in a bowl with the juice of the lemon, rice vinegar, sesame oil, soy sauce and honey.",
    "Whisk the dressing ingredients together until the honey dissolves.",
    "Toss the cabbage and carrot with the dressing, then scatter over the toasted cashews."
  ],
